# Netlify _redirects file for J&A Freight Systems
#
# NOTE: A catch-all SPA redirect (/* → /index.html 200) is intentionally
# NOT included here. This is a multi-page static site — each page is its
# own .html file and should 404 correctly when a nonexistent URL is visited.
#
# Custom 404 behavior is handled in netlify.toml instead.
#
# Add specific redirects below if you ever rename a page URL, e.g.:
#   /old-page   /new-page   301

